-- Purpose: temporarily satisfy the stock Drizzle PostgreSQL migrator's
-- database CREATE check for its unconditional CREATE SCHEMA IF NOT EXISTS.
-- Prerequisites: roles and postgres-owned drizzle schema are already present;
-- folioone_migrator has USAGE, CREATE on drizzle and CREATE on public; the
-- approved migration execution path is the stock Drizzle Kit runner; the
-- SQL Editor session is an authorized database owner/admin. This privilege is
-- not needed when the owner manually executes DDL that does not issue CREATE
-- SCHEMA. Never grant it to folioone_runtime.
-- Execution order: execute immediately before the approved Drizzle Kit
-- migrate run; then execute 004 immediately after the runner exits.
-- Repeatability: GRANT is idempotent. Do not leave this privilege in place.
-- Expected outcome: folioone_migrator temporarily has database CREATE so the
-- stock runner can execute CREATE SCHEMA IF NOT EXISTS drizzle. This does not
-- grant CREATEDB or alter schema/object ownership.

GRANT CREATE ON DATABASE postgres TO folioone_migrator;

-- Post-execution verification (read-only):
SELECT has_database_privilege('folioone_migrator', 'postgres', 'CREATE')
  AS migrator_database_create;

-- Expected: true. Proceed only with the intended migration operation, then
-- execute 004. Do not use the runtime connection for migrations.

-- Rollback if no migration operation was started:
-- REVOKE CREATE ON DATABASE postgres FROM folioone_migrator;
-- If a migration ran, this privilege revoke is cleanup, not a schema rollback.
-- RETIRED — DO NOT EXECUTE.
-- This temporary database CREATE grant existed only for the removed
-- folioone_migrator role. DDL is now manually authored for postgres execution.

